{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.StaircaseRowDeletedHook","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.StaircaseRowDeletedHook","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.StaircaseHookMultiset"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD_card","kind":"theorem","line":232,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L232-L239","doc":"The row-deleted shape has `T_{k−r} + T_r + r(k−r+1)` cells, i.e. `n = T_k + r`: the\nhook-sum decomposition at `g ≡ 1`.  Ported from #7802 (`cornerBlockYD_card`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeleted_hookSum_ge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeleted_hookSum_ge","kind":"theorem","line":221,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L221-L230","doc":"With a nonnegative `g`, the row-deleted shape's hook sum dominates the two staircase sums: the\nrectangle term is dropped.  This is the step `Σ ε(h) ≥ S_δ(k−r) + S_δ(r)` of the lower bound.\nPorted from #7802 (`cornerBlock_hookSum_ge`, an independent derivation of the same bound). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD_zero","kind":"theorem","line":215,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L215-L219","doc":"At `r = 0` the shape is the staircase itself. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeleted_hookSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeleted_hookSum","kind":"theorem","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L130-L213","doc":"**The hook sum of `λ_{k,r}`**: two staircases and an even rectangle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeleted_hook_rect","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeleted_hook_rect","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L123-L128","doc":"Hooks in the rectangle (`i < r`, `j ≤ k − r`): EVEN, `2(k − i − j)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeleted_hook_corner","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeleted_hook_corner","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L115-L121","doc":"Hooks in the upper-right block (`i < r`, `k − r < j`): a copy of `δ_r`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeleted_hook_low","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeleted_hook_low","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L108-L113","doc":"Hooks in the lower block (`r ≤ i`): a copy of `δ_{k−r}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD_colLen_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD_colLen_le","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L98-L106","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD_colLen_gt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD_colLen_gt","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L88-L96","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD_rowLen_ge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD_rowLen_ge","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L78-L86","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD_rowLen_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD_rowLen_lt","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L68-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.mem_rowDeletedYD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.mem_rowDeletedYD","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L62-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.rowDeletedYD","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/StaircaseRowDeletedHook.lean#L46-L60","doc":"`λ_{k,r}`: the staircase `δ_k` with one outer corner on each of its top `r` rows. ","signatureChunk":0}]}